1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,480
In 1822, a man sold land... in a country that didn't exist.

2
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:08,571
And about 250 people packed up their lives... to move there.

3
00:00:08,821 --> 00:00:12,153
He printed a guidebook, a flag... even his own money.

4
00:00:12,353 --> 00:00:15,615
In London, he launched a £200,000 Poyais loan.

5
00:00:15,815 --> 00:00:22,230
Families bought land. Men bought jobs. A cobbler became "Shoemaker to the Princess."

6
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,760
Then they swapped their gold... for Poyais dollars.

7
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,550
Two ships sailed for Poyais.

8
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:31,886
They found no capital. No farms. Just jungle.

9
00:00:32,086 --> 00:00:33,668
Fewer than 50 ever came home.

10
00:00:34,409 --> 00:00:39,345
And MacGregor? A French court tried him... and let him go.

11
00:00:39,545 --> 00:00:43,207
He died in Venezuela, with a military pension and a hero's funeral.

12
00:00:43,457 --> 00:00:47,450
Everything he sold was fake. Only the money he took was real.
